# Wading Beasts (Bastok 2-2): begun in Bastok Markets. A level 10 Warrior of Bastok (1-1 to 2-1 completed by a GM;
# Resonance current keeps RoV 1-1 out). Cleades: section 1: 1001, finished with 4: Bastok Markets' own
# handleAcceptMission registration: begun, YOU_ACCEPT_THE_MISSION. Section 2: ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET + 21. Rival
# zone-in, another mission's script: the login in Bastok Markets plays Seekers of Adventure's Rumors from the West
# onZoneIn, which returns 22 (the trace records only that return, with no event packet).
lists BastokMarkets/Cleades/onTrigger BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/1001
char zone=BastokMarkets pos=-358,-10,-168 job=WAR lvl=10 nation=1
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Bastok TheZeruhnReport completed
mission Bastok GeologicalSurvey completed
mission Bastok Fetichism completed
mission Bastok TheCrystalLine completed
login
trigger Cleades                         # section 1: 1001
finish option=4                         # 4: begun, YOU_ACCEPT_THE_MISSION
trigger Cleades                         # section 2: ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET + 21
